          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do weekly audits work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Every week, we crawl every page of your site and runs 100+ SEO checks — title tags, meta descriptions, H1 structure, canonical URLs, Open Graph tags, schema markup, page speed, mobile friendliness, broken links, image alt text, and more. You receive a branded HTML report with your score, grade, findings, and fix-it prompts. The report also includes keyword rankings, backlink monitoring, and your AI Optimization on-page score."
          }
        },
