          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do you measure results?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "By the leads we can track. Your monthly report shows the leads we can track, such as form leads and, when you give us access, Google Business Profile calls and direction requests, next to the search and site work behind them. If something can't be tracked yet, we tell you."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What if I find something wrong in my report?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Every report includes fix-it prompts. Simply reply to the report email describing what you want us to address — for example, \\"Fix the canonical URLs\\" or \\"Add meta descriptions to the blog posts.\\" Our fix system processes approved requests, applies the changes to your site, re-crawls, re-audits, and sends you an updated report confirming everything is resolved. This applies to Full Management — on the Rank Labs Visibility Report plan, Rank Labs makes no changes to your site and you are responsible for implementing all fixes."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I cancel anytime?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. The Rank Labs Visibility Report ($399/mo) is month-to-month. For Full Management, a 6-month contract gets the first month free and the $999 migration fee waived; otherwise it is month-to-month plus a $999 migration fee. You keep full ownership of your site, content, and domain — nothing is locked into our platform."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do I get started?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Visit our pricing page to compare plans. For the Rank Labs Visibility Report ($399/mo), contact us and we'll set it up. For Full Management ($1,249/mo), provide your website URL and complete checkout via Stripe — your first SEO audit arrives within 24 hours, and weekly reports begin on your scheduled day (Mon–Thu)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }`} />

